-names></name><name><surname>Downs</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name><name><surname>Biddle</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Jollis</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cost-effectiveness of transesophageal echocardiography to determine the duration of therapy for intravascular catheter-associated Staphylococcus aureus bacteremia</article-title><source>Ann Intern Med</source><year>1999</year><volume>130</volume><fpage>810</fpage><lpage>820</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10366370</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>